Maintainer: Adriano Rutz <adafede@gmail.com>
Description: Translates tandem mass spectrometry (MS/MS) spectral libraries into diagnostic fragment and neutral-loss ion queries for chemical structure and skeleton classification, ranked by Matthews Correlation Coefficient (MCC).
